sequenceDiagram
 participant Client
 participant API
 participant Domain
 participant Store
 participant Queue
 participant Worker
 participant Sink
 Client->>API: 取消訂單
 API->>Store: 讀取
 API->>Domain: Cancel(before)
 Domain-->>API: Order, RefundRequested
 alt 首次狀態轉換
 API->>Store: 寫回
 API->>Queue: await WriteAsync
 end
 Note over API,Sink: 入列完成後可回應；Worker送達與回應無固定先後
 API-->>Client: transitioned, refund_requested
 Queue->>Worker: 取工作
 Worker->>Sink: 通知payload
 Note over API,Store: 讀判寫不是整體原子；不承諾並行恰好一次
